  </PawnKindDef>

  <ThingDef ParentName="CVG_PuppetRaceBase">
    <defName>CVG_Puppet_Bronze</defName>
    <label>bronze guardian puppet</label>
    <description>Zhuge Liang's wooden oxen carried grain over the mountains; the Valley cast its gate guardians in bronze instead, in the likeness of the clay soldiers buried with the first emperor, and gave them fists rather than weapons. Heavy and patient, this puppet holds the line for its master and grows stronger as the master's realm rises.

War puppet (tier 2): melee front-liner with heavy bronze fists and thick plating; slower than the blade puppet. Fights with the strength of its master's realm, up to Foundation Establishment. Stiffens in the cold. 1 thread. Needs war threads research and a Foundation master. Built from 40 spirit steel, 15 spirit thread and 1 blueprint.</description>
    <statBases>
      <BandwidthCost>1</BandwidthCost>
      <MoveSpeed>3.2</MoveSpeed>
      <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.45</ArmorRating_Sharp>
      <ArmorRating_Blunt>0.3</ArmorRating_Blunt>
    </statBases>
    <race>
      <lifeStageAges>
        <li>
          <def>MechanoidFullyFormed</def>
          <minAge>0</minAge>
          <soundWounded>Pawn_Mech_Militor_Wounded</soundWounded>
          <soundDeath>Pawn_Mech_Militor_Death</soundDeath>
          <soundCall>Pawn_Mech_Militor_Call</soundCall>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>MechanoidFullyFormed</def>
          <minAge>100</minAge>
          <soundWounded>Pawn_Mech_Militor_Wounded</soundWounded>
          <soundDeath>Pawn_Mech_Militor_Death</soundDeath>
          <soundCall>Pawn_Mech_Militor_Call</soundCall>
        </li>
      </lifeStageAges>
    </race>
    <tools>
      <li>
        <label>bronze fists</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Blunt</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>13</power>
        <cooldownTime>2.0</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>Torso</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
        <alwaysTreatAsWeapon>true</alwaysTreatAsWeapon>
        <ensureLinkedBodyPartsGroupAlwaysUsable>true</ensureLinkedBodyPartsGroupAlwaysUsable>
      </li>
    </tools>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="Convergence.DefModExtension_PuppetTier">
        <tier>2</tier>
        <combat>true</combat>
        <minMasterRealm>2</minMasterRealm>
        <minMasterStage>1</minMasterStage>
        <capRealm>2</capRealm>
        <capStage>4</capStage>
        <materialHediff>CVG_PuppetMaterial_Iron</materialHediff>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </ThingDef>

  <PawnKindDef ParentName="LightMechanoidKind">
    <defName>CVG_Puppet_Bronze</defName>
    <label>bronze guardian puppet</label>
    <race>CVG_Puppet_Bronze</race>
    <combatPower>50</combatPower>
    <lifeStages>
