  <ThingDef ParentName="CVG_PuppetRaceBase">
    <defName>CVG_Puppet_Jade</defName>
    <label>jade guardian puppet</label>
    <description>Only a grandmaster dares to carve jade around a beast core: the core remembers being alive and must be persuaded, every day, to obey. Fast, hard and deadly, the jade guardian is the pride of a puppet master and the envy of the sects; the living core pulls twice as hard on the master's threads (2 bandwidth).

War puppet (tier 4): the strongest, with jade needles at range; it can also hunt. Fights with the strength of its master's realm, up to Ascension. Almost no weaknesses. 3 threads. Needs jade threads research and a master at the peak of the Golden Core. Built from 50 spirit jade, 25 spirit thread, 2 blueprints and 1 beast core.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>4.4</MoveSpeed>
      <!-- Elite puppet: the beast core inside pulls twice as hard on the master's threads. -->
      <BandwidthCost>3</BandwidthCost>
      <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.4</ArmorRating_Sharp>
      <ArmorRating_Blunt>0.3</ArmorRating_Blunt>
    </statBases>
    <race>
      <mechEnabledWorkTypes>
        <li>Hunting</li>
      </mechEnabledWorkTypes>
      <baseHealthScale>1.5</baseHealthScale>
      <lifeStageAges>
        <li>
          <def>MechanoidFullyFormed</def>
          <minAge>0</minAge>
          <soundWounded>Pawn_Mech_Militor_Wounded</soundWounded>
          <soundDeath>Pawn_Mech_Militor_Death</soundDeath>
          <soundCall>Pawn_Mech_Militor_Call</soundCall>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>MechanoidFullyFormed</def>
          <minAge>100</minAge>
          <soundWounded>Pawn_Mech_Militor_Wounded</soundWounded>
          <soundDeath>Pawn_Mech_Militor_Death</soundDeath>
